WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.170
In this video, you will review the homes your neighbors enter, add homes yourself, and undo a mistake.

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.291
We start on the map.

00:00:08.195 --> 00:00:12.257
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.257 --> 00:00:14.382
That is the only address you need.

00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:18.517
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:22.261
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:23.599
Tap Use my location.

00:00:25.342 --> 00:00:29.779
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.984
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:32.984 --> 00:00:37.545
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:41.043 --> 00:00:43.732
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:43.732 --> 00:00:44.928
See the three dots?

00:00:44.928 --> 00:00:49.230
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:49.768
Tap them.

00:00:51.371 --> 00:00:53.185
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:56.689
Tap Mine, your personal page.

00:00:58.381 --> 00:01:00.450
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:03.322
Now tap Entries.

00:01:03.322 --> 00:01:05.938
Nothing goes on the map until you approve it.

00:01:07.747 --> 00:01:11.855
At the top is Add homes yourself, for homes you already know about.

00:01:11.855 --> 00:01:12.761
Tap it to open.

00:01:14.485 --> 00:01:18.047
Paste one address per line, with a name after a bar, if you like.

00:01:19.054 --> 00:01:20.647
Then tap Check addresses.

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.934
Nothing is added yet.

00:01:24.018 --> 00:01:25.501
Each line is looked up.

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:26.675
Found means ready.

00:01:26.675 --> 00:01:28.158
Not found means a typo.

00:01:28.158 --> 00:01:30.568
Already in means it is in your contest.

00:01:32.095 --> 00:01:35.999
Tick the box to confirm the residents agreed to have their address shown.

00:01:37.649 --> 00:01:39.121
Then tap Add 3 homes.

00:01:41.514 --> 00:01:45.610
The new homes are on the map and the ballot, tagged Added by organizer.

00:01:47.959 --> 00:01:49.367
Added one by mistake?

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:51.799
Tap Remove, then tap again to confirm.

00:01:53.475 --> 00:01:54.371
Tap again.

00:01:56.468 --> 00:01:58.803
Homes your neighbors enter wait for you.

00:01:58.803 --> 00:02:00.682
If one looks right, tap Approve.

00:02:00.682 --> 00:02:03.530
It joins the contest, and the neighbor is emailed.

00:02:05.414 --> 00:02:07.526
If one does not belong, tap Decline.

00:02:09.256 --> 00:02:11.751
A kind note helps the neighbor try again.

00:02:11.751 --> 00:02:13.117
Then tap Decline entry.

00:02:16.156 --> 00:02:17.428
Changed your mind?

00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:18.566
Tap Undo decline.

00:02:20.448 --> 00:02:22.794
Next up: Add your city's homes yourself.
